  "details": "Hey guys, it's Bubba Rottweiler and I want to talk to you about the VRChat issue that I'm having. You see, when I click on a world to visit it, and click the \"launch world\" button, I get this message that says \"Open world protocols\" or something like that, but when I refresh the page and try again, it still does not open the window. I don't know if it's happening to other users, but it's happening to me right now. Can you please fix this issue? So I can visit worlds and interact with other users. Thank you!",
